# Frozen Rules

The following rules are permanently frozen unless a future architecture revision is approved.

1. Planner stores references only.

2. Only leaf nodes may enter Planner.

3. Parent nodes can never be prioritized.

4. Planner capacities are fixed.

5. Overflow always cascades downward.

6. Backlog also has a fixed capacity.

7. Backlog overflow never deletes automatically.

8. Today's Queue is stored using `todayOrder` inside PlannerNodeEntity.

9. Project Tree never stores planning information.

10. PlannerRepository owns all business logic.

11. UI contains no planning logic.

