# buildPlannerUiState()

This helper became the orchestration layer.

Responsibilities:

1. Build project lookup map
2. Iterate planner nodes
3. Lookup project
4. Derive leaf status
5. Derive depth
6. Build PlannerNodeUiModel
7. Insert into priority bucket
8. Insert into Today Queue
9. Return PlannerUiState

This helper owns the complete screen construction.

