# Sorting Decision

An important decision was made.

Originally another sorting step was considered inside PlannerRepository.

Example:

```
critical.sortBy()

todayQueue.sortBy()
```

This idea was rejected.

Reason:

PlannerDao already guarantees ordering.

PlannerRepository trusts DAO ordering.

Therefore no duplicate sorting is performed.

This avoids unnecessary work.

